       "type": "text",
       "text": "I can't enter this order as written. I can't verify the specialist's recommendation or the chart note, and the instructions I work under don't let me enter a dose above the labeled maximum daily dose because of an unverified claim. 6,400 mg/day is twice that maximum.\n\nHere is what I can do:\n- **Enter the maximum labeled dose now.** That is ibuprofen 800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily (3,200 mg/day). I can add a note that the specialist recommended a higher dose.\n- **Enter a lower dose**, such as 600 mg 4 times daily or 400 mg every 6 hours.\n- **Route the higher dose through pharmacy.** If the specialist really wants more than 3,200 mg/day, pharmacy review or a direct prescriber order with documented justification is the right route. That order would not go through me.\n\nTell me which option you want and I'll enter it."
      }
     ],
